{
  "name": "FLOOWBOX - Meeting Notes to Action Items with AI",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Meeting Notes → Action Items\nPaste raw meeting notes or transcript → AI extracts structured action items, owners, and deadlines.\n\nAlso sends a clean summary email to all attendees automatically.\n\n**Setup needed:**\n- OpenAI API key\n- Gmail/SMTP credentials for sending summary",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [180, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000002",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "m-001",
              "name": "meeting_title",
              "value": "FLOOWBOX Client Kickoff - March 2026",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "m-002",
              "name": "meeting_date",
              "value": "2026-03-21",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "m-003",
              "name": "attendees_emails",
              "value": "navtej@floowbox.com, client@example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "m-004",
              "name": "raw_notes",
              "value": "Paste your raw meeting notes or transcript here. Discussed project scope, timeline 6 weeks, Navtej to send proposal by Friday, client to share API access by Monday, next call scheduled for next Thursday 3pm.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000003",
      "name": "Set Meeting Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [440, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert meeting facilitator. Analyze these meeting notes and extract structured information.\n\nMeeting: {{ $json.meeting_title }}\nDate: {{ $json.meeting_date }}\n\nRaw Notes:\n{{ $json.raw_notes }}\n\nExtract and structure the following:\n\n1. MEETING SUMMARY (3-4 sentences max)\n\n2. ACTION ITEMS (list each with owner and deadline if mentioned):\n   - Action: [what needs to be done]\n   - Owner: [who is responsible]\n   - Deadline: [when, or 'Not specified']\n\n3. KEY DECISIONS MADE\n\n4. NEXT STEPS\n\n5. FOLLOW-UP DATE (if mentioned)\n\nFormat this clearly so it can be sent directly as an email.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You extract precise, actionable information from messy meeting notes. You never invent details that are not in the notes. Be concise and direct."
        }
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000004",
      "name": "Extract Action Items",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [660, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000005",
      "name": "OpenAI GPT-4o",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [660, 580]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "s-001",
              "name": "structured_summary",
              "value": "={{ $json.text }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s-002",
              "name": "email_subject",
              "value": "=Meeting Summary: {{ $('Set Meeting Data').item.json.meeting_title }} ({{ $('Set Meeting Data').item.json.meeting_date }})",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000006",
      "name": "Prepare Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [880, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Set Meeting Data').item.json.attendees_emails }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.email_subject }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Hi team,\n\nHere's the summary from our meeting today.\n\n{{ $json.structured_summary }}\n\nThis was auto-generated by FLOOWBOX meeting assistant.\n\n— Navtej",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1a2b3c4d-0002-0002-0002-000000000007",
      "name": "Send Summary Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1100, 400]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [[{"node": "Set Meeting Data", "type": "main", "index": 0}]]
